      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Total population = 9,097 (matches MASTER). The 内 (\"of which\") below the figure introduces the male and female runs. Note that the printed components do not reconcile: 男 4,854 + 女 4,167 = 9,021, seventy-six short of this total. All three numbers were re-checked glyph by glyph and are recorded as printed."
